Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 18:02:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] nvmf/tcp: read C2H data into reserved socket buffers

Expose c2h_direct_sock in both the RPC schema and the Python CLI so it can
also be enabled when the NVMe/TCP target is configured at runtime.

Co-authored-by: Moshe Shahar <mooshons@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Jerome Tollet <jtollet@cisco.com>
